{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"a000000000000001","type":"text","x":-1460,"y":-620,"width":3160,"height":160,"text":"# Codex Remote 系统架构\n\n**当前：Mobile Web Gateway + Runtime Auth + iPhone + Relay + Mac Agent**　　**目标：独立 Admin Platform + Diagnostics Collector + SLS**\n\n[[系统总体架构]] · [[Mobile Web Gateway 与 Runtime 鉴权架构]] · [[ADR-008 Mobile Web Gateway 作为统一用户入口]] · [[Admin 与可观测平台架构]] · [[日志采集与诊断数据流]]"},
		{"id":"a000000000000002","type":"group","x":-1460,"y":-380,"width":1100,"height":700,"label":"当前已实现 · 实时通信与本地执行","color":"4"},
		{"id":"a000000000000003","type":"group","x":-280,"y":-380,"width":970,"height":700,"label":"目标架构 · Admin 与采集控制面","color":"5"},
		{"id":"a000000000000004","type":"group","x":770,"y":-380,"width":930,"height":700,"label":"目标架构 · 数据面","color":"6"},
		{"id":"a000000000000005","type":"text","x":-1400,"y":-300,"width":300,"height":210,"text":"## iPhone App\n\nProject · Thread · Turn\nUnified Logging · JSONL\nMetricKit · 本地导出","color":"5"},
		{"id":"a000000000000006","type":"text","x":-1030,"y":-300,"width":290,"height":210,"text":"## Relay Server\n\n`/ws/app` · `/ws/agent`\n实时路由 · 状态转发\n**不承载 Admin**","color":"6"},
		{"id":"a000000000000007","type":"text","x":-670,"y":-300,"width":250,"height":210,"text":"## Mac Agent\n\nCodex App Server\n项目授权 · Turn 执行\n结构化服务日志","color":"4"},
		{"id":"a000000000000008","type":"text","x":-1400,"y":-10,"width":980,"height":260,"text":"### 当前边界\n\n- iPhone WebSocket 主链保留，`spec_version: 2.0`\n- Mobile Web Gateway、Runtime Auth、HTTP/SSE 与 Runtime PostgreSQL/Valkey 已实现\n- 本地 Admin、Collector、Simulator 采集与 Incident 已实现\n- 公网 TLS/限流、生产批量上传、RBAC 和 SLS 尚未实现"},
		{"id":"a000000000000009","type":"text","x":-220,"y":-300,"width":420,"height":260,"text":"## Admin Server + Admin Web\n\nOverview · Users · Activity\nDevices · Diagnostics · Incidents\nArtifacts · Audit · Settings\n\nDiagnostics API 是 Admin 模块，不是 Relay API","color":"5"},
		{"id":"a00000000000000a","type":"text","x":230,"y":-300,"width":400,"height":260,"text":"## Diagnostics Collector\n\n独立进程 · launchd\nJSONL 增量采集\n确认后推进游标\nCoreDevice 白名单任务","color":"3"},
		{"id":"a00000000000000b","type":"text","x":-220,"y":30,"width":850,"height":220,"text":"### 平台边界\n\n- Admin Web 与 Admin Server 同一对外服务\n- Collector 同仓但独立进程，不直接写数据库\n- 浏览器不能提交 Shell、任意路径或 CoreDevice 参数\n- 用户、行为、技术日志、审计、附件分别授权与保留"},
		{"id":"a00000000000000c","type":"text","x":830,"y":-300,"width":370,"height":220,"text":"## 管理数据库\n\n本地/线上：PostgreSQL 14+\nCollector：checkpoint + spool\n\n用户 · 权限 · 任务\n事故 · 审计 · 附件索引","color":"4"},
		{"id":"a00000000000000d","type":"text","x":1260,"y":-300,"width":370,"height":220,"text":"## 阿里云 SLS\n\n技术日志 · 用户行为\nMetrics · Traces\n检索 · 分析 · 告警\n\niPhone SDK + STS","color":"6"},
		{"id":"a00000000000000e","type":"text","x":830,"y":-10,"width":800,"height":260,"text":"## 诊断附件存储\n\nMetricKit · Crash Logs · sysdiagnose · App 导出包\n\n本地附件目录 / 对象存储\n数据库只保存 Manifest、大小、SHA-256 和权限\n人类与 AI 读取同一 Incident Snapshot","color":"2"},
		{"id":"a00000000000000f","type":"group","x":-1460,"y":410,"width":3160,"height":370,"label":"统一 iPhone 诊断逻辑","color":"3"},
		{"id":"a000000000000010","type":"text","x":-1400,"y":490,"width":980,"height":220,"text":"## 开发与线上共同逻辑\n\n先落盘 · 密封日志段 · 持久队列\n条数/大小/时间组批 · 失败退避 · 容量上限\n启动/前台/网络恢复补传 · MetricKit 落盘"},
		{"id":"a000000000000011","type":"text","x":-340,"y":490,"width":920,"height":220,"text":"## 开发环境额外能力\n\nCoreDevice App Data Container 拉取已密封文件\nsystemCrashLogs 与 sysdiagnose 分级确认\n\n**CoreDevice 是兜底，不是第二套日志系统**","color":"5"},
		{"id":"a000000000000012","type":"text","x":660,"y":490,"width":970,"height":220,"text":"## OOM / Jetsam 证据链\n\n强杀前落盘 + 下次启动补传 + MetricKit\n+ systemCrashLogs + 必要时 sysdiagnose\n\n不依赖 terminate、内存警告或固定后台任务","color":"1"},
		{"id":"a000000000000013","type":"group","x":-1460,"y":860,"width":3160,"height":610,"label":"当前已实现 · Mobile Web Gateway 与 Runtime Auth","color":"4"},
		{"id":"a000000000000014","type":"text","x":-1400,"y":940,"width":360,"height":270,"text":"## Mobile Web 浏览器\n\n同源 `/v1/*`\nAccess Token 仅存内存\nRefresh Token 使用 HttpOnly Cookie\n配对码只从 URL Fragment 读取","color":"5"},
		{"id":"a000000000000015","type":"text","x":-960,"y":940,"width":390,"height":270,"text":"## Mobile Web Gateway `18774`\n\n局域网唯一浏览器入口\n静态资源 + 精确路由 allowlist\nSSE 透传 · 安全响应头\n未来 Tunnel 只连接此入口","color":"4"},
		{"id":"a000000000000016","type":"text","x":-490,"y":940,"width":390,"height":270,"text":"## Run Server `18775`\n\n仅监听 Loopback\nRuntime HTTP/SSE + Auth API\n`RuntimeAuthModule` 插件边界\nServer 分配 Scope，Gateway 不是信任边界","color":"6"},
		{"id":"a000000000000017","type":"text","x":-20,"y":940,"width":390,"height":270,"text":"## Runtime 数据层\n\nPostgreSQL：权威 Runtime + Auth\nValkey：实时加速，不承载 Auth\nOpaque Token 只保存 Secret 哈希\nRefresh Rotation 事务化","color":"3"},
		{"id":"a000000000000018","type":"text","x":-490,"y":1250,"width":390,"height":160,"text":"## Auth Control `18776`\n\n同一 Relay 进程 · 独立 Loopback Listener\n配对授权 · 客户端撤销 · 不经过 Gateway","color":"2"},
		{"id":"a000000000000019","type":"text","x":920,"y":940,"width":710,"height":270,"text":"## 公网边界 · 尚未开放\n\n稳定域名 + TLS · `AUTH_COOKIE_SECURE=true`\n公网限流与连接/Body 上限 · 固定 Cloudflare Tunnel\n\n`*.trycloudflare.com` 只适合临时联调，不作为长期配对 Origin","color":"1"}
	],
